      "display_name": "DeepStream YOLOX Metadata Probe v0",
      "runtime": "deepstream",
      "description": "DeepStream 8.0 + pyds metadata probe running YOLOX-S (COCO-80) instead of the TrafficCamNet sample model. Same pyds pad probe / BoundedBridgeQueue seam as deepstream.metadata_probe.v0; the PGIE config is the registry-driven YOLOX plan (raw official ONNX + custom grid-decode bbox parser, FP16 engine cached in the host model store). Requires operator-prepared artifacts (scripts/prepare_yolox_model.sh). Status/debug evidence only -- no observations, no metadata adapter, no API writes. No tracker, no analytics.",
      "outputs": [],
